{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網上流傳一段車Cam片段，拍到有 2 女 1 男懷疑違規走進屯門行車天橋範圍。當時橋上車流穿梭不斷，三人卻手持手機於路旁駐足，險象環生，引來大批網民圍觀熱議。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-14-10h58m58s868.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026jF4DimTkaz1789355143.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-14-10h58m58s868.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">片段顯示，事發時天色已黑，天橋不時有大型巴士等車輛駛過。畫面中可見，2 女 1 男站在天橋邊的欄杆旁，各人手持電話查看，身處位置極為狹窄，場面令人捏一把冷汗。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-14-10h59m04s612.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026lsFicLj32H1789355124.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-14-10h59m04s612.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">影片引來網民瘋狂洗版討論，不少人直斥涉事行人的行為危險，留言表示：「黐線」、「點會行到上去」。對於三人為何會闖上天橋，網民亦紛紛推測其動機，認為三人手持電話的模樣極似遊客，懷疑他們因依賴手機導航帶路而誤闖行車道，打趣兼無奈留言：「係咪畀個導航老點？」</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T03:18:48.920410+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":285,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}